  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, prepare dressing by whisking together lime juice, olive oil, honey, cumin, salt, and pepper."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry cilantro. Shave leaves off the stems; discard the stems and mince the leaves. Add to dressing and mix. Set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry arugula."
    },
    {
      "text": "Halve and pit avocados; scoop out and medium dice the flesh. Wash and peel mangoes; slice flesh away from pit and medium dice. Peel and thinly slice onion into half rings."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, arrange a bed of arugula on a plate and top with onion, avocado, and mango. Drizzle with dressing and sprinkle with pine nuts. Enjoy!"
    }
  ]
